WEBVTT

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:40.280
Riru, grow.

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:42.060
Summon Kukuri, Ichihito.

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:42.940
Turn end.

00:01:42.940 --> 00:01:44.260
Let's go, Ruuko.

00:01:44.260 --> 00:01:46.140
Yeah. Yuzuki, grow!

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:50.040
<i>She's using a mainly red deck.</i>

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:53.500
<i>I'll wear her down and then break through!</i>

00:01:53.940 --> 00:01:55.350
Summon Amethyst.

00:01:55.350 --> 00:01:58.260
Summon effect: banish Ichihito!

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:02.350
Riru!

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:04.030
I'm fine.

00:02:04.030 --> 00:02:05.850
Suzu, it's our turn.

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:07.640
Right. Riru, grow!

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:10.400
Summon Kitsunesaku, Fi-ax, and Hanayari!

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:12.780
Activate attacks and do a full attack!

00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:14.640
Guard!

00:02:18.130 --> 00:02:19.530
Yuzuki, grow!

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:21.160
Coin bet!

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:23.280
Burning!

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.000
Riru!

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:33.650
Okay, we're winning.

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:34.210
Yeah!

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:37.840
<i>She's strong!</i>

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:40.040
<i>Will she keep attacking?</i>

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:41.140
<i>Or...</i>

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:43.260
Suzu...

00:02:44.210 --> 00:02:45.040
Right!

00:02:46.820 --> 00:02:48.190
Coin bet!

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:51.600
Honest!

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:56.280
Coin bet?

00:02:56.740 --> 00:02:58.880
Tell me your plan.

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:01.180
Um...

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:05.620
I'll use ARTS: Flaming Stubbornness 
on an enhanced Ryuju SIGNI,

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:07.870
then finish the game 
quick with an assassin...

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:09.520
Huh?

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:11.780
Ruuko, why'd you just come out and tell her?

00:03:11.780 --> 00:03:14.100
I don't know! Why did I do that?

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:15.880
Is this her power?

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:18.560
<i>It doesn't look like she 
has another LRIG to use.</i>

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:19.670
<i>Then...</i>

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:20.380
Unlock.

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:21.780
Coin bet!

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:32.190
It's not Tama?

00:03:32.570 --> 00:03:33.600
And one more...

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:36.900
Suzu, don't be reckless.

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:40.400
I don't think I can beat her 
unless I use my full strength.

00:03:40.760 --> 00:03:44.280
I can't lose until I get 
Chi-chan's memories back.

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:46.240
Coin bet!

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:48.300
Suzu's amazing.

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:49.620
This is so exciting.

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:51.710
Berserk!

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:00.740
Turn end.

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:02.370
She's not attacking?

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:07.080
<i>What is this?</i>

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:10.430
<i>No. I haven't even grown yet...</i>

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:11.810
Ruuko?

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:15.740
Attack!

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:18.980
Dominating Lightning!

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:25.940
Yuzuki!

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:29.450
<i>The power to force me to attack?</i>

00:04:30.050 --> 00:04:32.620
<i>She keeps going beyond what I expect...</i>

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:33.750
<i>She's strong!</i>

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:39.950
Which way?

00:04:39.950 --> 00:04:41.720
I know she's close.

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:42.600
Roger.

00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:44.380
Then let's find a place with a clear view.

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:47.970
There's another battle going on...

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:50.680
Layla and Carnival?

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:58.940
Oh, dear. So violent.

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:02.150
Hey, asshole! Stop standing there watching!

00:05:02.150 --> 00:05:03.490
Come join the fun!

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:05.430
Why? There's no need.

00:05:05.430 --> 00:05:07.600
Anonymous is still doing fine.

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:08.850
Right, Anonymous?

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:13.290
Oh, Carnival-sama, 
you're so hard on your LRIGs.

00:05:13.740 --> 00:05:15.660
It's my turn now.

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:16.920
Turn end.

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:19.130
Without even attacking?

00:05:19.530 --> 00:05:20.380
Correct.

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:22.300
Or summoning another LRIG?

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:22.840
Correct.

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:27.440
In other words, I'm just supposed 
to stand here and be attacked?

00:05:27.440 --> 00:05:29.300
That's what you like, right?

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:32.010
So mean...

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:33.860
You little shit...

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:35.370
Coin bet!

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:37.590
Doping.

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:41.140
If you want your ass kicked that bad,

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:44.820
I'll hurt you so much, you can 
never fight again, you pervert!

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:53.160
I'm going to lose!

00:05:53.610 --> 00:05:55.830
Spell: Mad Dancing Flames!

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:57.920
Buff all cards and attack!

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:01.590
Riru, Meru, L-Again!

00:06:08.210 --> 00:06:11.010
<i>Those LRIGS work so well together...</i>

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:14.850
<i>Like they were partners to begin with.</i>

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:17.360
<i>It's two versus one, but I 
still can't finish this.</i>

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:18.850
<i>She really is...</i>

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:21.310
<i>Strong!</i>

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:32.070
Ruu... are you... battling?

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:35.300
Ruu?

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:44.300
Hope.

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:47.370
We should be able to see the 
whole area from up here.

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:48.050
Right.

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:56.930
They're not here?

00:06:57.240 --> 00:06:58.290
Absent.

00:06:58.290 --> 00:07:00.060
Are they indoors somewhere?

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:01.550
Ruuko...

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.670
Th-There they are! I found them!

00:07:12.430 --> 00:07:13.070
Confirmation.

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:16.320
That has to be them!

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:17.170
Let's go!

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:18.290
Wait.

00:07:18.720 --> 00:07:22.080
I think it'll be over by 
the time we get there.

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:23.940
We need to stop their battle now.

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:25.420
But how?

00:07:26.280 --> 00:07:28.670
We have to force it to end.

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:32.630
If a third party who doesn't know 
about the battles enters that area,

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:34.870
the battlefield should be shut down.

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:36.250
A third party?

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:38.880
Idea.

00:07:38.880 --> 00:07:41.480
I don't know if it'll work or not, but...

00:07:43.550 --> 00:07:45.150
Well, what next?

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:47.330
Her Life Cloth is at 0.

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:51.070
If you don't come down now, I'll finish her.

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:53.070
Yeah, do it.

00:07:53.290 --> 00:07:55.430
Huh? You're going to lose!

00:07:55.430 --> 00:07:56.920
I said do it.

00:07:56.920 --> 00:07:59.990
This battle's boring. I'm done with it.

00:07:59.990 --> 00:08:01.180
Go ahead.

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:03.040
Don't hold back.

00:08:16.110 --> 00:08:17.470
You asshole...

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:20.180
You never planned to win from the start?

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:21.850
It killed some time.

00:08:22.840 --> 00:08:25.850
They should be finishing 
their battle now, too.

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:27.600
What are you thinking?

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:29.790
No matter who's standing in front of you,

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:31.400
you crush them. Destroy them.

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:33.290
That's what a Selector battle is, right?

00:08:33.290 --> 00:08:34.630
Not enough.

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:37.490
That's not enough.

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:39.990
A Selector. One who chooses.

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:42.900
And I'm the one making the choices here.

00:08:42.900 --> 00:08:45.230
I'm going to make a new world...

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:48.810
Who will it be that entertains me there?

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:52.670
Who will make it to the next stage?

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:57.140
This battle is an audition, 
and you're the ones trying out!

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:02.020
That smirk pisses me off...

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:06.160
I'm going to do what I want.

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:09.310
Either way, if I crush 
all the other Selectors,

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:12.400
you'll have to fight me for real.

00:09:14.600 --> 00:09:18.120
Struggle as hard as you can, Selector.

00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:22.660
Yuzuki!

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:26.120
Damn it...

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:27.960
I'm not done yet.

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:30.340
<i>I can't win like this.</i>

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:35.840
ARTS: Flaming Stubbornness.

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:37.300
And then, coin bet.

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:39.320
R-Ruuko, that's crazy!

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:41.580
If you lose this fight, you'll be out of coins!

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:43.520
I have to win.

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:47.850
I decided I have to save 
Tama... save my friend.

00:09:48.800 --> 00:09:50.810
She's doing this for her friend, too?

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:53.610
I see.

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:54.610
That's right.

00:09:55.550 --> 00:09:56.490
Burning!

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:02.870
Suzu, it's coming.

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:06.370
Here I go!

00:10:15.730 --> 00:10:17.510
Huh? Where's the photoshoot?

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:19.510
Nobody's here.

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:22.250
Yeah. No way they'd do a photoshoot here.

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:23.720
You put it up on a social network?

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:25.800
Sent.

00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:30.210
I uploaded false information that an idol 
was doing a photoshoot in this park,

00:10:30.210 --> 00:10:31.400
along with the address.

00:10:31.840 --> 00:10:34.150
I hope someone comes to check it out...

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:37.070
There they are!

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:38.560
Ruuko!

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:40.000
Hitoe!

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:40.910
Hana-chan?

00:10:41.610 --> 00:10:43.870
Good. Looks like we made it.

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:45.530
Mizushima-san.

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:45.530
Kiyoi-chan?

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:55.860
The memories you want back 
might not be all good ones.

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:00.560
I'm sorry.

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:03.360
I was so impatient to save my friend,

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:05.450
I ended up forcing you into a battle...

00:12:06.310 --> 00:12:10.890
No, I was thinking the same thing.

00:12:10.890 --> 00:12:12.030
Inevitable.

00:12:12.030 --> 00:12:14.770
So it was one of Carnival's plots, then.

00:12:14.770 --> 00:12:17.830
We were lucky we got there 
before the battle ended.

00:12:17.830 --> 00:12:18.800
But...

00:12:19.160 --> 00:12:20.450
Shock!

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:23.900
I can't believe I'm meeting 
Kurebayashi-san again like this.

00:12:24.570 --> 00:12:25.680
Right?

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:29.430
I'm really surprised that you 
and Hitoe know each other, too.

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:32.890
We met by chance at the 
store where you work.

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:35.400
Did the manager say anything?

00:12:35.610 --> 00:12:37.230
He asked for you to call in.

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:38.420
Crap...

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:40.770
I can't keep it a secret from 
my family forever, either...

00:12:40.770 --> 00:12:41.670
Yeah.

00:12:41.670 --> 00:12:43.520
We have to do something soon.

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:45.560
For Yuzuki and Tama,

00:12:45.560 --> 00:12:48.040
and for Hanayo-san and Midoriko-san, too.

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:51.520
We all have our reasons for 
participating in the battles.

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:52.970
To protect something.

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:54.710
To get something back.

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:57.810
What Carnival said was true.

00:12:58.300 --> 00:13:01.890
This battle is a fight to determine the 
master of the room of white windows.

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:04.220
All the answers are in that room.

00:13:04.650 --> 00:13:09.100
Only the person who can go there and 
have their wish granted is the winner.

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:10.080
Kiyoi-chan,

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:12.970
is it true that the room of 
white windows summoned you?

00:13:12.970 --> 00:13:13.750
Yes.

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:18.310
I think I've been given the 
same information Carnival has.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:19.440
Tell me.

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:21.550
What's happening to Tama now?

00:13:21.550 --> 00:13:24.360
She was summoned to that room as the keyhole.

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:26.520
I think it was Carnival who took her.

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:28.560
Question.

00:13:28.560 --> 00:13:32.410
What is the "Eternal" that Suzuko-san 
heard about from Carnival?

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:35.590
Eternal... The Eternal Girl?

00:13:35.590 --> 00:13:37.870
I heard voices. Lots of them.

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:43.810
What I felt was an inorganic 
and merciless system

00:13:43.810 --> 00:13:46.280
that drives the Selectors 
toward the battles,

00:13:46.280 --> 00:13:48.520
and an evil will flowing toward its source.

00:13:48.520 --> 00:13:51.420
And... sadness.

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:54.390
Sadness?

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:58.030
Probably the sadness of everyone who was 
ever involved in the Selector battles.

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:01.150
"Why must it be me and no one else?"

00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:06.140
"If I have to suffer like this, 
why shouldn't everyone else?"

00:14:07.560 --> 00:14:09.490
I understand a little, maybe.

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:13.320
All of us came from that room.

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:20.000
The job of the LRIG of the beginning is to invite 
the girl in front of her to join the battles,

00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:24.170
cleverly luring her into 
the world of cruel battles.

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:26.360
We don't remember it anymore,

00:14:26.360 --> 00:14:33.390
but inside each of us might still remain 
the unfulfilled desires of those girls.

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:34.680
Yeah...

00:14:35.480 --> 00:14:40.400
Then that "Eternal" is 
watching us fight and laughing?

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:41.860
Hypothesis.

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:46.570
Eternal may wish for Carnival to 
become the master of the room.

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:49.050
It's letting him control the battles.

00:14:49.050 --> 00:14:51.200
I thought the same thing.

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:53.680
But when I went to that room,

00:14:53.680 --> 00:14:56.500
I had a vague sense that 
there was another mind there.

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:57.620
Another mind?

00:14:58.590 --> 00:15:01.710
It was so faint, like it might 
disappear at any moment.

00:15:02.120 --> 00:15:04.830
Like it would run away if I tried to grab it.

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:10.580
The one thing I do know is that if 
Carnival becomes the master of that room,

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:13.180
the chain of darkness will never end.

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:14.300
Yeah.

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:19.670
If there's anything we can do...

00:15:19.670 --> 00:15:20.620
Ruuko...

00:15:20.620 --> 00:15:23.080
I don't want anyone else to suffer.

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:23.940
Yeah.

00:15:24.300 --> 00:15:25.270
Yeah.

00:15:26.080 --> 00:15:27.420
Conclusion.

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:32.320
We can decide later who goes 
to the room of white windows.

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:36.670
For now, we need to work together 
to defeat Carnival and Layla.

00:15:36.670 --> 00:15:38.400
Are you okay with that, Kominato-san?

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:40.500
Call me Ruuko, Kiyoi-chan.

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:44.300
Okay, Ruuko.

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:50.800
Homura Suzuko, Kominato Ruuko...

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:52.970
Both of them survived.

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:55.570
Good... Good girls.

00:15:56.190 --> 00:15:59.340
Now then, which do I devour first?

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:05.020
It's late...

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:07.420
I wonder if Dad's home.

00:16:11.500 --> 00:16:12.650
Chi-chan?

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:14.570
Suzu?

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:15.820
What's wrong?

00:16:16.520 --> 00:16:18.130
Nothing.

00:16:18.130 --> 00:16:20.060
I thought I might find you here.

00:16:20.820 --> 00:16:22.580
I wanted to see you again...

00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:24.320
Sorry. Bye.

00:16:24.320 --> 00:16:27.400
Wait! Chi-chan, you're acting weird.

00:16:28.910 --> 00:16:30.550
Did something happen?

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:33.840
I remember it...

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:36.370
Just for a moment, 
like a jolt of electricity...

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:39.030
I feel my memories scattered 
all around the city.

00:16:39.030 --> 00:16:41.520
Each time I do, my heart 
feels like it's being choked.

00:16:43.840 --> 00:16:47.510
You said that my memories 
weren't all good ones, right?

00:16:47.510 --> 00:16:48.480
Well...

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:52.870
I can tell that I did something terrible.

00:16:54.300 --> 00:16:56.320
I'm scared to face it.

00:16:57.620 --> 00:16:59.630
I decided to accept it,

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:00.780
but I'm scared.

00:17:01.260 --> 00:17:04.770
I'm scared I'll feel like 
I won't belong next to you.

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:07.980
That I won't be able to see you anymore.

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:14.550
No matter what happens, 
I'll stay with you, Chi-chan.

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:16.300
Suzu...

00:17:20.490 --> 00:17:21.950
This is far enough.

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:23.700
Thanks for walking me home.

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:24.480
It's okay.

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:28.360
I decided to believe you, 
but I complained anyway.

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:29.310
I'm sorry.

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:30.420
Chi-chan...

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:33.480
Are you really okay?

00:17:33.480 --> 00:17:34.900
Do you need me with you?

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:36.160
Meru...

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:39.440
Yeah. Help Suzu, okay?

00:17:39.440 --> 00:17:40.120
Bye.

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:45.720
Chi-chan...

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:50.920
A New Message Has Arrived

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:56.300
It should be done soon

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:56.300
Once it's all over,
let's hang out a bunch!

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:00.970
<b>As long as it's not karaoke.</b>

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:11.110
Hitoe, morning!

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:12.570
Morning!

00:18:12.810 --> 00:18:14.030
Good morning!

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:17.530
Are we a little late?

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:19.060
Yeah, let's hurry.

00:18:23.190 --> 00:18:25.040
There you are!

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:26.240
Layla-san...

00:18:26.240 --> 00:18:27.380
What are you doing here?

00:18:27.380 --> 00:18:28.310
What am I doing here?

00:18:28.310 --> 00:18:30.920
I want to do it so bad, I can't help myself!

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:34.000
I can't have someone else taking you,

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:37.120
like that asshole Carnival 
tried to do yesterday.

00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:38.930
You're my prey.

00:18:39.140 --> 00:18:40.160
Fine.

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:42.430
Let's do it.

00:18:43.960 --> 00:18:45.270
A battlefield opened.

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:47.540
One is Ruuko.

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:49.760
The other is... Layla?

00:18:49.760 --> 00:18:51.190
Why?

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:52.400
Hypothesis.

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:55.280
The enemy must have approached her first.

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:56.580
No...

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:17.920
Yuzuki, grow!

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:20.470
Summon Snow Sled, Reflected Letter.

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:21.380
Turn end.

00:19:21.380 --> 00:19:26.350
Yuzuki? What happened 
to that LRIG named Tama?

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:30.000
If you don't take this 
seriously, you'll regret it.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.240
Unlock. Coin bet.

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:42.090
Here I go!

00:19:42.090 --> 00:19:43.450
Summon Segwey!

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:50.160
I'm not done yet!

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:56.640
Despair, anger, hatred...

00:19:56.640 --> 00:19:59.700
I was born as an LRIG from 
that pile of filthy shit,

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:02.050
and the one faint memory I have...

00:20:03.520 --> 00:20:07.220
is of a maddening desire for strength.

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:10.520
I'll carve my power

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:12.080
into my opponent,

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:13.810
and myself,

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:15.650
with my fists!

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:18.020
That proves I'm alive!

00:20:18.020 --> 00:20:19.360
Yuzuki!

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:21.820
Ruu...

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:23.150
Ruu...

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:26.740
Ruu is fighting.

00:20:28.240 --> 00:20:29.270
Yukki...

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:31.270
Is that you, Yukki?

00:20:31.270 --> 00:20:32.410
That's right.

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:35.210
Where are you, Yukki?

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:36.320
Right here.

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:39.200
You and I are one.

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:40.170
Here?

00:20:40.910 --> 00:20:42.860
Ruu is fighting alone.

00:20:43.640 --> 00:20:45.430
You want to fight, don't you, Tama?

00:20:45.650 --> 00:20:47.990
Yeah, I want to fight!

00:20:47.990 --> 00:20:49.390
I want to save Ruu!

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:50.760
That's right.

00:20:50.760 --> 00:20:53.560
For Ruu, the girl we love...

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:58.010
Yukki!

00:20:59.080 --> 00:21:01.150
Go to Ruu.

00:21:01.510 --> 00:21:03.280
Okay, got it!

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:10.370
Yuzuki!

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:13.330
Ruu!

00:21:14.770 --> 00:21:15.790
Tama!

00:21:16.020 --> 00:21:18.290
I'm gonna battle!

00:21:20.360 --> 00:21:21.340
Okay!

00:21:21.860 --> 00:21:24.500
Unlock! Coin Bet!

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:33.520
Tama?

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:37.310
I've been waiting for this.

00:21:50.430 --> 00:21:53.870
Now, let's begin.

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:55.910
The Eve / Trust and Betrayal

00:23:26.640 --> 00:23:27.870
I'll let you choose.

00:23:27.870 --> 00:23:29.160
I was chosen!

00:23:29.160 --> 00:23:30.450
This is my choice!

00:23:30.450 --> 00:23:32.020
You chose nothing!

00:23:32.020 --> 00:23:34.320
You really do belong with me!

00:23:34.320 --> 00:23:35.930
Looks like everything has come together.

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:38.570
Goodbye. Be careful, okay?

00:23:37.770 --> 00:23:40.940
Choice / Battle and Battle

00:23:38.570 --> 00:23:40.940
"Choice / Battle and Battle."
